          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "道路使用許可――完全に、理解したァ!!",
          "en": "Road use permits— I've got 'em totally figured out!!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p10-2-1",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "……ちゃんとしてる。テツなのに",
          "en": "... He did it properly. Tetsu, of all people."
        },
        {
          "id": "p10-3-1",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "許可さえ取っちまえば、あとは何人来ようが自由!!",
          "en": "Get the permit, and then anyone can come!!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p10-4-1",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "……本当に？",
          "en": "... Really?"
        },
