          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "眼鏡が光らないと、誰も真似できません",
          "en": "Nobody can copy it if the glasses don't flash."
        },
        {
          "id": "p11-5-1",
          "panel": 5,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "光らねえなら――光らせりゃいい!!",
          "en": "If they don't flash— then MAKE 'em flash!!"
        }
      ]
